<title>USA: Simms holds 5.1348 pct ThrustMaster stake.</title>
<headline>Simms holds 5.1348 pct ThrustMaster stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simms Capital Management Inc said Wednesday it holds a 5.1348 percent stake in ThrustMaster Inc or 209,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Simms said it bought 72,000 common shares between June 14 and September 9 at prices ranging from $4.377 to $5.13 per share.</p>
<p>Simms said it bought the shares for investment purposes.</p>
